@startuml usecase-counter-work
left to right direction
title Use Case Diagram(Collection Point Counter Work)

actor "Staff" as Staff
actor "Courier" as Courier

rectangle "Community Parcel Collection Point System" {
  usecase "Register incoming parcel" as UC_Register
  usecase "Shelve parcel" as UC_Shelve
  usecase "Search parcel" as UC_Search
  usecase "Verify pickup code and hand over" as UC_Handover
  usecase "Register parcel exception" as UC_Exception
  usecase "Issue pickup code" as UC_Code
}

Courier --> UC_Register : delivers batch
Staff --> UC_Register
Staff --> UC_Shelve
Staff --> UC_Search
Staff --> UC_Handover
Staff --> UC_Exception
UC_Shelve ..> UC_Code : <<include>>

@enduml
